      "cat-harness:section": "(top of file)",
      "prov:value": "Factored out of Process_SwarmDispatchAndMonitor in cat-harness#1397 (2026-11-24) to keep both phase diagrams under the 20-node house readability ceiling while adding explicit tasks and data-store/object associations for Task_AssignIdleComputeBacklog (assigning right-scoped non-heavy idle-backlog items to compute-bound workers without mid-build git checkout), Task_RefreshSwarmHandover (refreshing and pushing the parent Swarm Work Item's Cold-Start Handover Runbook to cat/cat-harness/beans on every routine check-in), and Mon_GwReportDue (supporting both on-demand and optional periodic human status reporting).",
